  "content": "\n\n<p>用於建立多面地毯的簡易函式庫。</p>\n<p>功能特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>內建可放置於地面／牆壁／天花板的複合方塊基底類別；</li>\n<li>實作了將原方塊替換為複合方塊的邏輯；</li>\n<li>提供模型、方塊狀態與戰利品表的資料生成輔助工具；</li>\n<li>支援 NeoForge 與 Fabric。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>設計理念為何？使用此函式庫可快速且高效地建立平面複合方塊。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1140721.svg\" alt=\"版本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"NeoForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"Forge\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcarpets-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我的其他模組：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"Carpet Variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"Copper Deco\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"Mob Loot Variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"Better Block Sounds Fork\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"Slime Overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"Polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"Big Water\"></a></p>",
